  "correct": "4",
  "solution": "Given equation: 13 + 26 × 2 − 5 ÷ 4 = 6.\n\nBODMAS Table: \n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/d50192f098c21078501d30eeafe1a8c64bc30dd9621c48caa8a39ffc60f68b64.png] \n\nLet's check each option one by one.\n\nOption 1) ÷ and +\n\nGiven: 13 + 26 × 2 − 5 ÷ 4 = 6\n\nAfter interchanging the signs we get;\n\n⇒ __**13 ÷ 26**__ × 2 − 5 + 4 = 6\n\n⇒ __**0.5 × 2**__ − 5 + 4 = 6\n\n⇒ __**1**__ − 5 __**+ 4**__ = 6\n\n⇒ __**5 - 5**__ = 6\n\n⇒ 0 ≠ 6\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 2) + and −\n\nGiven: 13 + 26 × 2 − 5 ÷ 4 = 6\n\nAfter interchanging the signs we get;\n\n⇒ 13 - 26 × 2 + __**5 ÷ 4**__ = 6\n\n⇒ 13 - __**26 × 2**__ + 1.25 = 6\n\n⇒ __**13**__ - 52 __**+ 1.25**__ = 6\n\n⇒ __**14.25 - 52**__ = 6\n\n⇒ -37.75 ≠ 6\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 3) × and −\n\nGiven: 13 + 26 × 2 − 5 ÷ 4 = 6\n\nAfter interchanging the signs we get;\n\n⇒ 13 + 26 - 2 × __**5 ÷ 4**__ = 6\n\n⇒ 13 + 26 - __**2 × 1.25**__ = 6\n\n⇒ __**13 + 26**__ - 2.5 = 6\n\n⇒ __39____ - 2.5__ = 6\n\n⇒ 36.5 ≠ 6\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\n**Option 4) × and ÷**\n\nGiven: 13 + 26 × 2 − 5 ÷ 4 = 6\n\nAfter interchanging the signs we get;\n\n⇒ 13 + __**26 ÷ 2**__ − 5 × 4 = 6\n\n⇒ 13 + 13 − __**5 × 4**__ = 6\n\n⇒ __**13 + 13**__ − 20 = 6\n\n⇒ __26 - 20__ = 6\n\n**⇒ 6 = 6**\n\n**⇒ LHS = RHS**\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"Option 4\".",
